# SHADOW-DEBUG-VIEWS: the directional-shadow view modes reach the deferred lighting pass (DeferredLighting.shader,
# ShadowUB DebugParams.z). Before: the mode reached only the forward MeshRenderer and the frame equalled Lit.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 0_lit Lit reference: barn, field, sky, sun shadows
Когда run View "View mode: Shadow Factor"
Тогда-вид 1_factor Shadow Factor: shadowed ground/sides black, sunlit surfaces white, no albedo colour; sky unchanged
Когда run View "View mode: Shadow Cascades"
Тогда-вид 2_cascades Shadow Cascades: the lit scene tinted red near, then green, blue, yellow bands with distance
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
